A||N||5||sdelgado||Headlight motor not going up||||1||
Z||000000||sdelgado||09-19-2001||11:35 AM||||Riddle me this, anybody!!!<P>I have an 86 2m4 and my right headlight motor only goes down.  I have swapped the relays from left to right and still the problem stayed on the right side. I have other motors and they all do the same for the right side (only go down). Since my left motor gears were stripped, I purchased the Rodney dickman rebuild kit and fixed the left motor.  I opened one of the right motors I have and the gears and rubber thingy were in perfect condition so I greased it up and put it back and now, it still does not go up but I can see it rotates very little.  If I try to manually turn the knob, it wants to go but doesn't.  <P>Any ideas, please help!<P>  ||||reg||1
Z||000001||sdelgado||09-19-2001||08:24 PM||||I will like to add that I swapped motors and both work but only when its connected to the left side, so I know both motors are good.<P>Can it be the wiring harness?||||reg||1
Z||000002||Ronnie||09-19-2001||08:53 PM||||Run 2 jumper wires from the left headlight relay directly to the wires on the right headlight. Thereby , bypassing the right headlight relay. See if that lets the motor work, since you say both motors are good.||||reg||6
Z||000003||sdelgado||09-20-2001||10:00 AM||||Insteresting!  I will try it today.  Thanks a lot.||||reg||10
Z||000004||sdelgado||09-23-2001||10:00 PM||||Thanks Ronnie, I ran wires directly from the motor on the left to the right and now both motors work. <P>Now, I have another problem.  My right motor goes up and only goes down half way???  It seems that the lever that makes the headlight go up and down is not hitting the rubber stopper, instead, it's hitting in between the two rubber stoppers.  At first, I thought I had put the lever the wrong way, but after trying several times, I can't seem to get it right???<P>Any suggestions, thanks in advance!!!||||reg||10
Z||000005||sdelgado||09-24-2001||09:57 PM||||HELP!<P>I searched the forum database and I have not seen this type of problem of headlight only going half-way down<P>I also check the motor and it seems to be spinning the correct direction.<P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
